2. The Minister declares that section 28 of the Act ceases to apply in relation to the following proceedings, whether commenced before, on or after 1 April 2022 and in respect of which no order under section 28(1) of the Act has been made before 1 April 2022:
(a)any proceedings in a Family Court constituted under section 3 of the Family Justice Act 2014;
(b)any proceedings in a Youth Court constituted under section 3 of the Family Justice Act 2014;
(c)any proceedings in a State Court constituted under section 3 of the State Courts Act 1970;
(d)any proceedings in the Supreme Court constituted under Article 94 of the Constitution of the Republic of Singapore, except any proceedings before a court of 3 Supreme Court Judges under the Legal Profession Act 1966.
